# SAM build output.
#
# This MUST stay listed. `sam build` writes its own generated template.yaml and a
# build.toml here, and `build/` above only covers .aws-sam/build — not build.toml,
# cache/ or deps/. Until 2026-08-04 those were caught incidentally by blanket
# `*.yaml` / `*.yml` / `*.toml` rules, which also hid the real deploy definition.
.aws-sam/

# DELIBERATELY TRACKED — do not re-add `scripts/`, `*.yaml`, `*.yml` or `*.toml` here.
#
# Those four patterns previously made template.yaml, samconfig.toml, docker-compose.yml
# and the whole scripts/ directory invisible to git. Only 12 files under backend/ were
# tracked, which meant the Lambda MemorySize the solver depends on lived in an untracked
# file, and a fresh clone had no way to deploy the backend at all. All four are checked in
# now and contain no credentials (samconfig.toml resolves S3/ECR at deploy time).

